<p>William Greider, <em>One World, Ready or Not: The Manic Logic of Global</em> <em>Capitalism </em>(1997); Bennett Harrison and Barry Bluestone, <em>The Great U-Turn: Corporate Restructuring and the Polarizing of America</em> (1998); Bethany Moreton, <em>To Serve God and Wal-Mart: The Making of Christian Free Enterprise</em> (2009); Robert B. Reich and John D. Donahue, <em>New Deals: The Chrysler Revival and the American System</em> (1986); and Susan J. Tolchin and Martin Tolchin, <em>Dismantling America: The Rush to Deregulate </em>(1985).
</p>


